{"_v":1,"id":"in-the-heights-2008","cat":"broadway","cs":76.47,"rc":6,"bd":{"positive":5,"mixed":1,"negative":0},"rv":[{"cn":"Hilton Als","o":"The New Yorker","s":79,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.newyorker.com/magazine/2008/03/31/crossing-over","d":"2008-03-31","q":"The show is an exuberant celebration of Latino culture in Washington Heights, with a score that mixes hip-hop, salsa, merengue, and pop in ways that feel both contemporary and timeless."},{"cn":"Linda Winer","o":"Newsday","s":75,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.newspapers.com/image/730788174/","d":"2008-03-10","q":"When the city has a blackout in sweltering July, the sidewalk becomes a refuge in the Upper Manhattan nabe where the George Washington Bridge can be seen overpowering the buildings."},{"cn":"Charles Isherwood","o":"The New York Times","s":75,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.nytimes.com/2008/03/10/theater/reviews/10heig.html","d":"2008-03-10","q":"Its fundamental deficiencies are also along for the ride, unfortunately."},{"cn":"John Simon","o":"Bloomberg","s":81,"b":"Positive","t":2},{"cn":"Eric March","o":"Theater Life","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://theaterlife.com/in-the-heights-2/","d":"2010-04-05","q":"All the tweaking has turned the evening into an immensely satisfying experience that is sure to charm even the most entrenched cynic."},{"cn":"Martin Denton","o":"Nytheatre","s":62,"b":"Mixed","t":3,"q":"In the Heights has got a beat; it's got energy. But it's finally so much less than it ought to have been!"}],"au":{"score":92.26,"designation":"Loving","sources":{"mz":{"s":88,"c":269,"sr":4.4},"ss":{"s":94,"c":659}}},"tn":[{"yr":62,"cat":"Best Musical","n":null,"w":true},{"yr":62,"cat":"Best Original Score","n":"Lin-Manuel Miranda","w":true},{"yr":62,"cat":"Best Choreography","n":"Andy Blankenbuehler","w":true},{"yr":62,"cat":"Best Orchestrations","n":"Alex Lacamoire","w":true},{"yr":62,"cat":"Best Orchestrations","n":"Bill Sherman","w":true},{"yr":62,"cat":"Best